<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM load factor rises in July.</title>
<headline>KLM load factor rises in July.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Provisional traffic and load factor figures from KLM Royal Dutch Airlines (millions of tonne-kilometres unless otherwise stated):</p>
<p>			   July '97   July '96 Apr-July 97 Apr-July 96</p>
<p>TOTAL TRAFFIC</p>
<p>Traffic			869.9     791.0     3,204.0    2,904.1</p>
<p>Capacity		   1,092.0   1,042.8     4,090.9    3,913.0</p>
<p>Load factor (pct)	   79.7	75.9	  78.3	 74.2</p>
<p>PASSENGER TRAFFIC</p>
<p>Passenger kilometres   5,345.7   4,684.2    18,985.6   16,410.8</p>
<p>Seat kilometres	  6,347.9   5,876.2    23,658.2   21,856.4</p>
<p>Load factor (pct)	   84.2	79.7	  80.2	 75.1</p>
<p>FREIGHT TRAFFIC</p>
<p>Traffic			341.3     327.4     1,306.8    1,264.9</p>
<p>Capacity		     479.6     488.5     1,847.3    1,877.0</p>
<p>Load factor (pct)	   71.2	67.0	  70.7	 67.4</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
